# Wave T45 (Heritage kit): oldstatue — the OLD STATUE of the town tale 'The Statue's Shadow', realized at the statue garden's west edge (2,14) in the shipped column cell's place (WAVE-T45-HERITAGE-PLAN.md §3.3: a declared dressing realization — the tale's named centerpiece, same cell, same non-walkable dressing class). A weathered stone figure on a low plinth, one arm raised, moss in the joints, travellers' flower flecks at its foot. Fully opaque: the town grass is baked in (measured #0e7f08, tg-eterna's rendered flat). (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T45-HERITAGE-PLAN.md §5.)
